      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CROYDON (1) is a promising type who notched his 21st career success when too good (29.80) at Sandown last time. Solid winning record at this trip. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Hard to go past. MIGHTY MISS (2) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only half a length from Caco Missile in second (30.42) at this track. Well-placed to take this out. BLACK MARVEL (8) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on October 17 over 525m at this track behind Paw Brutus beaten 1.3 lengths (30.34). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Racing well and deserves a win.",
